      "简介": {
       "英文": "Misaki Park (みさき公園) was an amusement park located in the town of Misaki in Osaka Prefecture, Japan, operated by Nankai Electric Railway Co., Ltd. The park was opened on April 1, 1957, coinciding with the 70th anniversary of Nankai Railway.\nThe park's zoo and aquarium were closed on March 31, 2020, with the land and facilities transferred to the town of Misaki the following day. The town transformed the area into a nature park which opened on July 1, 2021.\n\n"
